	(text "MIDI loop and audio pass through all three (main board -> front board headers -> panel jacks); RUN and BOOT end at the tact switches on the front board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "83528c92-9fe8-4ce8-9982-fee3c6f9d073")
	)
	(text_box "PicoFace hardware - the module as three sheets (10 HP, hardware/Panel/panel_10hp.svg)\n- Main board (sheet 2), 45 x 80 mm: RP2350-Plus, PCM5102 DAC, MIDI in/out, module bus (power/MIDI, audio), board-to-board headers. Format-independent.\n- Front board (sheet 3), 45 x 80 mm: three EC11 with pull-ups, RUN/BOOT tact switches, the OLED, sockets to the main board, header for the panel-wired jacks.\n- Panel (sheet 4): the four 3.5 mm jacks (M8, two TRS for MIDI, two for audio), optional USB-C lead. Wired, no PCB.\n- Power nets GND / +3V3 / VSYS are global (power symbols) and also travel over J1/J3; they are not drawn as sheet pins.\n- Status: drawn, not laid out, not fabricated. Panel-mounted parts are excluded from any board (on_board = no) but stay in the BOM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
